1
00:00:02,300 --> 00:00:04,700
Blue cheese gnocchi for two.

2
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:08,000
Chop a leek, nice and fine.

3
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:10,500
Then slice an onion.

4
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:14,000
Green pepper into the hot pan.

5
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:17,000
Now the onion joins it.

6
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:21,000
Cook slowly until soft and sweet.

7
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:24,500
Set it aside on a plate.

8
00:00:25,300 --> 00:00:29,500
Pour in the cream and let it warm up gently.

9
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:34,500
Stir in the blue cheese, the priciest part.

10
00:00:35,300 --> 00:00:39,500
Meanwhile, boil the
gnocchi until they float.

11
00:00:40,300 --> 00:00:43,000
Season with a little pepper.

12
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:47,000
Stir until the sauce is smooth.

13
00:00:47,800 --> 00:00:51,000
Bring the soft veg back into the sauce.

14
00:00:51,800 --> 00:00:55,000
Tip the cherry tomatoes into the sauce.

15
00:00:55,800 --> 00:00:58,500
Drain the gnocchi well.

16
00:00:59,300 --> 00:01:03,500
Add the gnocchi to the sauce
and mix it all together.

17
00:01:04,300 --> 00:01:07,000
Give it a good stir.

18
00:01:07,800 --> 00:01:12,000
Plate it up while it is nice and hot.

19
00:01:12,800 --> 00:01:15,000
Finish with grated Gruyère.

20
00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:18,000
And that's it. Ready to eat.

21
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:26,000
Total €9.70, €4.85 a serving. Follow for more.
